*GLOBAL*,Conventions,"COARDS, CF-1.6, ACDD-1.3, NCCSV-1.2"
*GLOBAL*,cdm_data_type,TimeSeries
*GLOBAL*,title,"Pacific Coast Ocean Buoy Observations"
*GLOBAL*,summary,"Hourly observations from NDBC buoys along the US Pacific Coast. Includes sea surface temperature, salinity, air temperature, and wind measurements."
